WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.263
Sit facing the machine, chest on the pad, handles together in front.

2
00:00:02.263 --> 00:00:04.527
Keep your arms almost straight and open them until they line up with your shoulders.

3
00:00:04.527 --> 00:00:06.790
Squeeze your shoulder blades, then bring the handles back slowly.
